{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-2985", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-2985", "text": "'Date \"$s\" is not a day. Use YYYY-MM-DD (today is '\n'${todayLabel(now ?? DateTime.now())}).'", "sha256": "50dd70bf2f1c01ab96b2663eca60bb91594e1adaffdfdb0c23a8e7c5d557ea6f", "kind": "dart", "start": 2985, "end": 3085, "line": 72}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-3481", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-3481", "text": "'Date \"$s\" is not a real calendar day.'", "sha256": "87d386f183ade4c02194b874e25c465301d91280353673a3481112c318d580b5", "kind": "dart", "start": 3481, "end": 3520, "line": 83}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-3759", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-3759", "text": "'Time \"${str(v)}\" is not HH:MM on a 24-h clock.'", "sha256": "2989b5a6fd293538e38cb7a0e813cb5c8f0e91060f6e36cf4e290adf0f66de9e", "kind": "dart", "start": 3759, "end": 3807, "line": 92}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-3941", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-3941", "text": "'Time \"${str(v)}\" is not a real time of day.'", "sha256": "969cadfbe2be4c68c8bfb174f09110bf238466e7334976e85ca8ef4810b37a86", "kind": "dart", "start": 3941, "end": 3986, "line": 96}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-5763", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-5763", "text": "'get_ecg_reading needs a reading_id.'", "sha256": "b0f774e0e18cf4e80469e7f172ea7c24db4f5e2d78180d4e607f737d2d7f324b", "kind": "dart", "start": 5763, "end": 5800, "line": 138}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-5989", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-5989", "text": "'No ECG reading with id $readingId.'", "sha256": "195d532438f966a38e05d8e14c36bee2746e38ef78ef7c7c79994c868f1a4c1a", "kind": "dart", "start": 5989, "end": 6025, "line": 143}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-7515", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-7515", "text": "'WHOOP MG band (HeartKey result; category is the band\\'s)'", "sha256": "f23210552845c1671a1572731e5d8a99733cbe2dabc8e5974b0dedc2588c5e91", "kind": "dart", "start": 7515, "end": 7573, "line": 183}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-7868", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-7868", "text": "'consecutive samples in filtered input-referred microvolts at '\n'effective_rate_hz; null where the accepted window has a missing '\n'segment. stride 1 is every sample the band sent.'", "sha256": "f1103933521fb5ddb5179f70f9d7db5236f3690bca1c335c1890ec3bc8abf32f", "kind": "dart", "start": 7868, "end": 8077, "line": 191}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-8345", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-8345", "text": "'The band acquires at 500 Hz and hands HeartKey those '\n'raw samples; what you get here is the band\\'s own filtered and '\n'5:1 decimated 100 Hz output. One sample is 10 ms, so every '\n'interval or width you measure is quantised to 10 ms — enough '\n'for rate and regularity, coarse for QRS width, and marginal '\n'for P-wave detail. The 500 Hz raw is not available to you.'", "sha256": "6f6a9aa3c351b39849a4aef6318d5fa9286b0db9db4911517abae26580e0d579", "kind": "dart", "start": 8345, "end": 8786, "line": 199}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-8807", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-8807", "text": "'Integer input-referred microvolts, already scaled on the '\n'band. No further conversion.'", "sha256": "cb0d80d0ba69dfe480aab3b28c17419d78670a0c2397ec74fa09be47ff3cfa53", "kind": "dart", "start": 8807, "end": 8911, "line": 205}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-8935", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-8935", "text": "'Anatomical lead orientation is NOT proven. Do not infer '\n'axis, or read R/S direction as anatomical.'", "sha256": "6bec85d37bdabe3c0757496fc9adaf75eafd820820d9c2c994a6bf27c7001497", "kind": "dart", "start": 8935, "end": 9052, "line": 207}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-9074", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-9074", "text": "'The BAND\\'s own average over the reading. It is not '\n'measured from these samples. If you state an RR interval or '\n'beat-to-beat variation, measure it from the samples and say so '\n'— do not present 60/avg_hr as a measurement.'", "sha256": "3226b852b3a412e6c86c2159a305443eab0f377609a0678da3f89b5021b82eb0", "kind": "dart", "start": 9074, "end": 9346, "line": 209}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-9369", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-9369", "text": "'The band\\'s own 0-3 signal-quality scale, higher is '\n'better; it climbs as contact settles.'", "sha256": "ca892ae5109606a9455185bc230cf06767aab9a52db8ab733548571425b764f6", "kind": "dart", "start": 9369, "end": 9477, "line": 213}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-9506", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-9506", "text": "'Times contact was lost and the band restarted its '\n'progress. missing_segments are whole seconds absent from the '\n'accepted window, and appear as null runs in samples.'", "sha256": "635b2edc00db993984488b61e4235bf3e0ac34155f0120d64b556b527e0ea4b0", "kind": "dart", "start": 9506, "end": 9705, "line": 215}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-9729", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-9729", "text": "'The band\\'s HeartKey result mapped by the app. Your own '\n'reading of the trace is your own; say plainly if they differ.'", "sha256": "f26e85224ac0d3efe49155260b52184a46a1d7df1e1d9b57300be13d3d6e38aa", "kind": "dart", "start": 9729, "end": 9865, "line": 218}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-9894", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-9894", "text": "'Band-reported. Not a diagnosis: no lead polarity is proven and '\n'the phone classifies nothing from the waveform.'", "sha256": "6081df4213738b0e2f8cee2f8efb0386a15c9dc3f3d5f7fa02f4ec48db0d61f3", "kind": "dart", "start": 9894, "end": 10021, "line": 221}
{"id": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart:offset-12368", "file": "lib/coach/coach_actions.dart", "location": "offset-12368", "text": "'A food needs a name.'", "sha256": "3a0ebf2096eecdca08ee1d82d8463924f984781b01653b01e2b1b57758bd5a4a", "kind": "dart", "start": 12368, "end": 12390, "line": 287}
